{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Its fat, the tail.</b> Above it is called fat, yet not for the prohibition of eating, as it is written: ״כל חלב שור וכבש״ — this implies fat that is the same in ox, lamb, and goat, excluding the fat of the tail, which is not the same in all of them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:50.904719480Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}